<title>CANADA: BC Sugar Refinery Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>BC Sugar Refinery Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER, BRITISH COLUMBIA 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>FINANCIAL RESULTS</p>
<p>						   Year Ended</p>
<p>						     Sep 30,</p>
<p> (In Thousands of Dollars)		  1996	    1995</p>
<p> REVENUES				   $ 848,554    $ 825,380</p>
